How can we create an interactive webpage to calculate and compare the carbon footprint of using plastic, paper, and metal straws? We want to use the following formula to determine the carbon footprint of each material:
Carbon Footprint = (Weight of straw x Emissions per ton of material) / 2000
Assuming a plastic straw weighs 0.42 grams and emissions per ton of plastic are 1.8 metric tons, a paper straw weighs 0.75 grams and emissions per ton of paper are 0.91 metric tons, and a metal straw weighs 7.2 grams and emissions per ton of metal are 2.7 metric tons, what is the carbon footprint of each material? 
